# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

words is project
words purpose "Split a sentence into words with byte tests, build a reversed sentence in a buffer, and parse numbers; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
words target console
words version "0.1.0"
words language refined 1
words standardLibrary 1
words allows write console.stdout none
words requires none
words includesModule words
words entry words.main
